sequenceDiagram
  actor R as Researcher
  participant UI as UI app
  participant API as Apps API
  participant A as Agent app eqds-sp-KEY
  participant J as Job (registrar SP)
  participant G as UC + Lakebase + Apps ACL
  participant DB as registry.specialists
  participant M as Moderator

  R->>UI: key = KEY, click Register
  UI->>API: apps.get("eqds-sp-KEY")
  API-->>UI: url
  UI->>A: GET /healthz, GET /info
  A-->>UI: ok + spec (tools, access, tag, description)
  UI->>UI: validate spec (untrusted input)
  UI->>J: run_now(key, spec, contract_checked)
  J->>API: apps.get -> url, service principal id
  J->>G: grant tables, functions, model EXECUTE, Lakebase role
  J->>G: moderator CAN_USE on the app
  J->>DB: upsert row, enabled = false
  J-->>UI: SUCCESS
  UI->>A: POST /invocations (one real call)
  A-->>UI: answer
  UI->>DB: enabled = true
  UI->>M: POST /registry/refresh
  M->>DB: reload roster
  Note over M,A: from now the moderator selects the agent by its description and calls its stored url
